    "summary": "- Invite tokens are 32 random bytes from crypto/rand, unpadded base64url (43 characters). The store keeps only their SHA-256 hash, and the token appears only in the invite email. No API answer or snapshot contains it.\n- Accept returns 404 `invite_not_found`, 410 `invite_used` or 410 `invite_expired` (older than 7 days on the service clock) as specified. Re-inviting an address (ignoring case) revokes the old invite, and GET lists only pending invites, each with `expires_at`.\n- `go build ./...`, `go vet ./...` and `go test ./...` pass, including a new `TestInviteTokens` that covers each rule.",
